B.c2d=new A.fP(B.dD,"Resilient Multi-Key Receipt Retrieval","Multi-field indexing ensures every student fee receipt is immediately visible in student and admin histories across student IDs, auth UIDs, and mobile numbers.","Receipts","receipt_long","/admin/receipts","View Receipts")
B.c2e=new A.fP(B.qG,"Instant QR Scan Expiration Verification","Scanning a student QR instantly displays valid, grace, or expired states with instant action to record renewal payments directly from the check-in sheet.","Admin Scanner","qr_code","/admin/qr-scanner","Open Scanner")
B.c2f=new A.fP(B.iG,"Direct Owner, Admin & Manager Helplines","Access separate direct contact numbers for the Library Owner, Admin, and Manager with instant Call and WhatsApp buttons directly from your profile and dashboard.","Direct Contacts","support_agent","/student/profile","View Contacts")
B.c2g=new A.fP(B.eS,"Categorized Quick Action Studio & Instant Petty Cash Logging","Upgraded the bottom (+) button into a high-speed Quick Action Studio grouped into Daily Transactions and Admissions/Notices. Added 5-second petty cash expense logging directly updating the Net Facility Profit.","Quick Action Studio","bolt","/admin/home","Try Studio (+)")
B.c2h=new A.fP(B.fI,"Multi-Notice Carousel & Dedicated Notice Board","Browse library announcements in a swipeable dashboard carousel with instant dismiss and view full historical circulars in the new Notice Board & Circulars hub.","Notice Board","campaign","/student/announcements","View Notices")
B.c2i=new A.fP(B.jW,"Library Logo & 3D Security Seal","Your digital pass now displays the official organization logo and authentic background watermark for verification.","Official Pass","account_balance",null,null)
B.c2j=new A.fP(B.oC,"Animated Instant Sync Button","Smooth rotating sync button with haptic feedback to instantly synchronize your latest profile data, seat allocations, and library details.","Live Sync","refresh",null,null)
B.c2k=new A.fP(B.lT,"Semantic Notification Deduplication & Self-Healing Purge","Eliminated duplicate alerts across student and admin notification hubs with semantic deduplication, 60-minute idempotency write-guards, and background orphan cleanup.","Zero-Duplication","notifications_active","/admin/home","Open Dashboard")
B.c2l=new A.fP(B.qE,"Historical Bulk Admission Date Customization & Cycle Alignment","Easily backdate student joining dates during bulk CSV import or 1-tap adjust dates in student profiles. Subscriptions automatically align with month-end or exact 30-day cycles with full audit trail.","Bulk Admissions & Dates","history_edu","/admin/students","Student Directory")
B.c2m=new A.fP(B.lR,"Guaranteed Seat Hold & 1-Tap Renewal Flow","Never lose your favorite desk. Active students get an exclusive seat reservation hold badge and a streamlined 1-tap renewal flow to lock in their seat effortlessly.","Seat Protection","lock","/student/renew","Review Renewals")
B.c2n=new A.fP(B.qH,"Anti-Fraud UTR Replay Defense & AC Power Surcharge","Automated bank/UPI UTR duplicate detection across payments preventing screenshot reuse, dedicated high-wattage power amenity toggle, and dynamic custom field regex validation.","Anti-Fraud & Ledger","shield","/admin/home","Collect Fee")
B.c2o=new A.fP(B.k0,"Live Quiet Desk Assistance Stream","Real-time alert banner on the admin console alerting front desk staff immediately with student desk numbers when quiet assistance or noise help is requested.","Front Desk","volume_off","/admin/feedback","View Desk Alerts")
B.c2p=new A.fP(B.H4,"Leading-App Navigation & Accidental Exit Prevention","Secondary bottom navigation tabs (Seats, Students, Settings) now smoothly navigate back to Home on back press. Accidental app closure is prevented with a 2-second double-tap exit guard.","Smart Back","navigation",null,null)
