B.c2u=new A.fP(B.iE,"Accurate Study Privileges & Facilities","The Perks and Environment sections now reflect only the genuine facilities provided by your library. Air Conditioning and extra perks only appear if actually equipped.","Real Perks","shield","/student/home","Explore Facilities")
B.c2v=new A.fP(B.Uj,"Birthday Celebration & 1-Tap Wi-Fi Password Copy","Celebrate your special day with festive greetings and copy the high-speed study Wi-Fi password with a single tap directly from your dashboard.","Student Delight","cake","/student/home","View Dashboard")
